# Cognigy environment credentials for multi-environment work
#
# HOW TO USE
#   1. Copy this file to  .env.local   (already gitignored; never commit real keys)
#   2. Fill in the values for the environments you want to use
#   3. Do NOT paste keys into chat. Claude is blocked from reading .env* files by the
#      env_guard hook and should never see them; probe scripts load the file themselves
#      (node --env-file=.env.local) and must never print values.
#
# NAMING
#   COGNIGY_PROFILE_<NAME>_<SETTING>
#   <NAME> is the profile name in upper case; use underscores, not hyphens
#   (profile "v4-staging" -> V4_STAGING). Add more profiles by copying a block.
#   These names are the same ones the engine will read once multi-environment
#   config lands, so what you fill in now keeps working.
#
# SETTINGS (per profile)
#   API_BASE_URL      required  API host (the engine adds "api-" to a bare UI host)
#   API_KEY           required  API key created in that environment's UI
#   PLATFORM_VERSION  optional  v2 | v4 | auto   (default: auto; auto-detect is built in Phase 1/2)
#   ENDPOINT_BASE_URL, WEBCHAT_BASE_URL, STATIC_FILES_BASE_URL
#                     optional  only if the hosts cannot be derived from the API host
#
# KEY HYGIENE
#   Use a key scoped as narrowly as the environment allows. For discovery, a read-only
#   or low-privilege key is ideal; Claude will only issue GET requests until you
#   approve a specific write.

# ---- Profile: classic v2 environment ------------------------------------------------
# Example host: https://api-trial.cognigy.ai
COGNIGY_PROFILE_V2_API_BASE_URL=
COGNIGY_PROFILE_V2_API_KEY=
COGNIGY_PROFILE_V2_PLATFORM_VERSION=v2

# ---- Profile: v4 staging ------------------------------------------------------------
# UI host is https://staging-v4.cognigy.ai. The API host below was DERIVED from the
# plugin's naming convention and answered 401 (so it exists and wants auth), but it is
# not confirmed to be the right API host. Replace it if your key page says otherwise.
COGNIGY_PROFILE_V4_STAGING_API_BASE_URL=https://api-staging-v4.cognigy.ai
COGNIGY_PROFILE_V4_STAGING_API_KEY=
COGNIGY_PROFILE_V4_STAGING_PLATFORM_VERSION=v4
